    <entry>
      <title>Nginx 反向代理实战：给 Next.js 应用做生产级部署</title>
      <link href="/posts/nginx-nextjs-reverse-proxy/"/>
      <url>/posts/nginx-nextjs-reverse-proxy/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Next.js 应用在生产环境通常跑成一个 Node 进程（<code>next start</code> 或 standalone 的 <code>node server.js</code>），默认监听 3000 端口。直接把 3000 端口暴露到公网能跑，但有三个问题：没有 HTTPS、静态资源没有缓存策略、慢客户端和长耗时请求会直接拖住 Node 进程。</p><p>正确的做法是在前面放一层 Nginx 做反向代理：Nginx 对外只开 80&#x2F;443，负责 TLS、压缩、缓存和超时控制；Node 进程只监听本机回环地址，专心渲染和跑接口。本文给出一份可直接套用的配置。</p><h1 id="架构：请求是怎么走的"><a href="#架构：请求是怎么走的" class="headerlink" title="架构：请求是怎么走的"></a>架构：请求是怎么走的</h1><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">浏览器 --HTTPS 443--&gt; Nginx --HTTP--&gt; 127.0.0.1:3000 (Next.js)</span><br><span class="line">                    (TLS / 压缩 / 缓存 / 超时)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>要点只有一个：<strong>公网只能访问到 Nginx，3000 端口不对公网开放</strong>。云服务器的安全组&#x2F;防火墙只放行 80 和 443；如果是 Docker 部署，端口映射写成 <code>-p 127.0.0.1:3000:3000</code>，只绑定本机回环。</p><h1 id="前置准备"><a href="#前置准备" class="headerlink" title="前置准备"></a>前置准备</h1><h2 id="Next-js-先以-standalone-方式跑起来"><a href="#Next-js-先以-standalone-方式跑起来" class="headerlink" title="Next.js 先以 standalone 方式跑起来"></a>Next.js 先以 standalone 方式跑起来</h2><p>在 <code>next.config.ts</code> 里开启 standalone 输出：</p><figure class="highlight ts"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">const</span> nextConfig = &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">output</span>: <span class="string">&quot;standalone&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">export</span> <span class="keyword">default</span> nextConfig;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>构建后运行生成的 server：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm run build</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># standalone 产物在 .next/standalone，需把 public 与 .next/static 一并拷进去</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cp</span> -r public .next/standalone/public</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cp</span> -r .next/static .next/standalone/.next/static</span><br><span class="line">PORT=3000 node .next/standalone/server.js</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>server.js</code> 默认监听 3000 端口（可用 <code>PORT</code> 环境变量改）。确认 <code>curl http://127.0.0.1:3000</code> 能返回页面后，再往下配 Nginx。生产上建议用 systemd 或 PM2 托管这个进程，保证崩溃后自动重启——本文只讲 Nginx 部分，进程托管不在此展开。</p><h2 id="域名解析到服务器"><a href="#域名解析到服务器" class="headerlink" title="域名解析到服务器"></a>域名解析到服务器</h2><p>在域名服务商处把域名（例如 <code>example.com</code>）的 A 记录指向服务器公网 IP。先确认 <code>ping example.com</code> 解析到的就是这台服务器，再做后面的 HTTPS 步骤。</p><h1 id="第一步：安装-Nginx"><a href="#第一步：安装-Nginx" class="headerlink" title="第一步：安装 Nginx"></a>第一步：安装 Nginx</h1><p>以 Ubuntu&#x2F;Debian 为例：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt update</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install -y nginx</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl <span class="built_in">enable</span> --now nginx</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>装完后访问服务器 IP 应能看到 Nginx 默认欢迎页。配置文件放在 <code>/etc/nginx/sites-available/example.com</code>，再软链到 <code>sites-enabled/</code>（Ubuntu&#x2F;Debian 的惯用做法；其他发行版可直接写在 <code>conf.d/</code> 下）。</p><h1 id="第二步：写一份可直接用的反向代理配置"><a href="#第二步：写一份可直接用的反向代理配置" class="headerlink" title="第二步：写一份可直接用的反向代理配置"></a>第二步：写一份可直接用的反向代理配置</h1><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># /etc/nginx/sites-available/example.com</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">server</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">listen</span> <span class="number">80</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">server_name</span> example.com www.example.com;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 上传上限：默认只有 1m，超过会直接报 413</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">client_max_body_size</span> <span class="number">50m</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># gzip 压缩：只压文本类资源，图片视频本身已压缩，不必再压</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">gzip</span> <span class="literal">on</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">gzip_types</span> text/plain text/css application/json application/javascript</span><br><span class="line">               text/xml application/xml text/javascript;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">gzip_min_length</span> <span class="number">1024</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># Next.js 的构建产物带内容哈希，文件名不变内容就不变，可以放心长缓存</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> /_next/static/ &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_pass</span> http://127.0.0.1:3000;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_cache_valid</span> <span class="number">200</span> <span class="number">1y</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">add_header</span> Cache-Control <span class="string">&quot;public, max-age=31536000, immutable&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 长耗时接口单独放宽超时：默认 proxy_read_timeout 只有 60 秒</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> /api/ &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_pass</span> http://127.0.0.1:3000;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_http_version</span> <span class="number">1</span>.<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> Host <span class="variable">$host</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> X-Real-IP <span class="variable">$remote_addr</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-For <span class="variable">$proxy_add_x_forwarded_for</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-Proto <span class="variable">$scheme</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="comment"># 注意：这个超时算的是“两次读取之间的静默时间”，不是请求总时长</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_read_timeout</span> <span class="number">600s</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_send_timeout</span> <span class="number">600s</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 其余请求全部交给 Next.js</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="section">location</span> / &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_pass</span> http://127.0.0.1:3000;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_http_version</span> <span class="number">1</span>.<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> Host <span class="variable">$host</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> X-Real-IP <span class="variable">$remote_addr</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-For <span class="variable">$proxy_add_x_forwarded_for</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-Proto <span class="variable">$scheme</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attribute">proxy_read_timeout</span> <span class="number">60s</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>几个容易忽略的点：</p><ul><li><strong>请求头必须透传</strong>。<code>Host</code> 不透传，Next.js 拿到的就是 <code>127.0.0.1:3000</code>；<code>X-Forwarded-For</code> 不透传，应用层看到的客户端 IP 永远是 Nginx 本机。日志、限流、风控都依赖这几个头，缺一不可。</li><li>**<code>proxy_http_version 1.1</code>**。默认是 1.0，1.0 不支持 keep-alive，每个请求都要重新建连；配了 1.1 才能复用上游连接。注意配了 1.1 后要显式处理 <code>Connection</code> 头（见下文 WebSocket 部分）。</li><li><strong><code>/api/</code> 的超时要单独放宽</strong>。<code>proxy_read_timeout</code> 默认 60 秒，文档转换、图片处理这类接口超过 60 秒没返回数据，Nginx 就会掐断并返回 504。只在 <code>/api/</code> 放宽到 600 秒，页面请求保持默认 60 秒，避免一个慢请求占住连接太久。</li><li>**静态资源缓存只给 <code>/_next/static/</code>**。页面 HTML 不能长缓存——它是不带哈希的动态内容，缓存了会导致用户看到旧页面。</li></ul><h2 id="可选：WebSocket-也要经过代理"><a href="#可选：WebSocket-也要经过代理" class="headerlink" title="可选：WebSocket 也要经过代理"></a>可选：WebSocket 也要经过代理</h2><p>Next.js 生产环境一般用不到 WebSocket，但开发环境的热更新（HMR）和某些实时功能需要。需要的话加一个 location：</p><figure class="highlight nginx"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="section">location</span> /_next/webpack-hmr &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">proxy_pass</span> http://127.0.0.1:3000;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">proxy_http_version</span> <span class="number">1</span>.<span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> Upgrade <span class="variable">$http_upgrade</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attribute">proxy_set_header</span> Connection <span class="string">&quot;upgrade&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>关键是 <code>Upgrade</code> 和 <code>Connection: upgrade</code> 两个头，没有它们，WebSocket 握手会在 Nginx 这一层失败。注意：生产部署不要把开发环境的 HMR 暴露出去，这段只在需要时才加。</p><h1 id="第三步：测试配置并重载"><a href="#第三步：测试配置并重载" class="headerlink" title="第三步：测试配置并重载"></a>第三步：测试配置并重载</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> <span class="built_in">ln</span> -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/example.com /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> nginx -t        <span class="comment"># 只检查语法，不生效；报错先修配置</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> nginx -s reload <span class="comment"># 平滑重载，不断现有连接</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>养成习惯：<strong>每次改完配置先 <code>nginx -t</code> 再 reload</strong>，不要直接 <code>systemctl restart nginx</code>。<code>nginx -t</code> 失败时 reload 不会执行，线上服务不受影响；直接 restart 一旦配置有错，Nginx 起不来就是全站宕机。</p><p>验证代理是否生效：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">curl -I http://example.com</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 应返回 200，且能看到 gzip 相关头；再确认页面内容与直接访问 3000 端口一致</span></span><br><span class="line">curl -s http://127.0.0.1:3000 | <span class="built_in">head</span> -5</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="第四步：用-Certbot-一键上-HTTPS"><a href="#第四步：用-Certbot-一键上-HTTPS" class="headerlink" title="第四步：用 Certbot 一键上 HTTPS"></a>第四步：用 Certbot 一键上 HTTPS</h1><p>Let’s Encrypt 证书免费，Certbot 的 Nginx 插件会自动改配置、配好 80 跳 443、并装好自动续期定时器：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install -y certbot python3-certbot-nginx</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> certbot --nginx -d example.com -d www.example.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>按提示填邮箱、同意服务条款、选择是否强制 HTTPS（选强制）。证书有效期 90 天，Certbot 装的定时器会每天检查、到期前自动续期。跑完后验证一次续期流程是通的：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> certbot renew --dry-run</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>注意两点：</p><ul><li>跑 Certbot 之前，<code>server_name</code> 必须已经是你的真实域名，且域名已解析到这台服务器，否则 HTTP-01 验证通不过。</li><li>Certbot 会在你的 server 配置里插入 <code># managed by Certbot</code> 的证书行，之后不要手改这些行，续期时 Certbot 会自己维护。</li></ul><h1 id="常见问题排查"><a href="#常见问题排查" class="headerlink" title="常见问题排查"></a>常见问题排查</h1><h2 id="502-Bad-Gateway"><a href="#502-Bad-Gateway" class="headerlink" title="502 Bad Gateway"></a>502 Bad Gateway</h2><p>Nginx 能收到请求，但连不上上游。按顺序查：</p><ol><li>Next.js 进程还在吗：<code>curl http://127.0.0.1:3000</code>，不通就是应用挂了，先重启应用。</li><li>端口对得上吗：配置里的 <code>proxy_pass</code> 端口要和 <code>PORT</code> 一致。</li><li>看 Nginx 错误日志：<code>sudo tail -f /var/log/nginx/error.log</code>，<code>connect() failed (111: Connection refused)</code> 就是上游没在监听。</li></ol><h2 id="413-Request-Entity-Too-Large"><a href="#413-Request-Entity-Too-Large" class="headerlink" title="413 Request Entity Too Large"></a>413 Request Entity Too Large</h2><p>请求体超过了 <code>client_max_body_size</code>，默认值只有 1m，传个稍大的文件就触发。按文件大小在 server 块里调大（上文配了 50m）。改完记得 <code>nginx -t &amp;&amp; nginx -s reload</code>；只改配置不重载是不生效的。</p><h2 id="504-Gateway-Time-out"><a href="#504-Gateway-Time-out" class="headerlink" title="504 Gateway Time-out"></a>504 Gateway Time-out</h2><p>上游超过 <code>proxy_read_timeout</code> 没返回数据。先确认接口本身是不是真的慢——是的话按上文把 <code>/api/</code> 的超时放宽；如果接口平时很快、偶尔 504，优先查应用日志和数据库慢查询，不要无脑加超时。超时只是兜底，不是修慢接口的办法。</p><h2 id="应用拿到的客户端-IP-不对"><a href="#应用拿到的客户端-IP-不对" class="headerlink" title="应用拿到的客户端 IP 不对"></a>应用拿到的客户端 IP 不对</h2><p>应用日志里全是 <code>127.0.0.1</code>，说明请求头没透传。检查 <code>proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;</code> 是否写了；应用层要读 <code>X-Forwarded-For</code> 的最后一项，那才是真实客户端 IP——链上每一跳都会把自己看到的来源 IP 追加到末尾，而前面的项客户端可以随意伪造；直接读连接来源 IP 读到的永远是 Nginx。</p><h2 id="改了配置，线上没变化"><a href="#改了配置，线上没变化" class="headerlink" title="改了配置，线上没变化"></a>改了配置，线上没变化</h2><p>三件套：<code>nginx -t</code> 是否通过、<code>nginx -s reload</code> 是否执行、浏览器是否走了缓存。先用 <code>curl -I</code> 绕过浏览器缓存验证，再怀疑配置。</p><h1 id="小结"><a href="#小结" class="headerlink" title="小结"></a>小结</h1><ul><li>Node 进程只监听 <code>127.0.0.1:3000</code>，公网只开 80&#x2F;443，所有流量经 Nginx 进出。</li><li>一份 server 配置覆盖五件事：请求头透传、gzip 压缩、<code>/_next/static/</code> 长缓存、<code>/api/</code> 长超时、上传大小限制。</li><li>改配置的固定流程是 <code>nginx -t</code> → <code>nginx -s reload</code>，不要直接 restart。</li><li>HTTPS 用 <code>certbot --nginx</code> 一键完成，证书 90 天有效、自动续期，跑完用 <code>renew --dry-run</code> 验证一次。</li><li>502 查上游进程、413 调 <code>client_max_body_size</code>、504 先查接口本身再放宽超时——三个报错各有明确的排查路径，不用凭感觉调配置。</li></ul>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
