        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>GitHub Actions 自动部署 Hexo 博客到 GitHub Pages</title>
      <link href="/posts/hexo-actions-deploy/"/>
      <url>/posts/hexo-actions-deploy/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>写 Hexo 博客最烦的环节不是写文章，而是部署：本地 <code>hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo generate &amp;&amp; hexo deploy</code> 三连击，换台电脑还要重装环境、重新配 Token，偶尔还会在部署那一步翻车。</p><p>更省事的做法是把部署交给 GitHub Actions：博客源码推到 GitHub，Actions 自动构建、自动发布。之后写文章的流程只剩两步：写 Markdown，<code>git push</code>。本文以官方文档为准，给出一份可直接照抄的工作流配置。</p><h1 id="为什么用-GitHub-Actions，而不是-hexo-deploy"><a href="#为什么用-GitHub-Actions，而不是-hexo-deploy" class="headerlink" title="为什么用 GitHub Actions，而不是 hexo deploy"></a>为什么用 GitHub Actions，而不是 hexo deploy</h1><table><thead><tr><th>方式</th><th>优点</th><th>缺点</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>hexo deploy</code> 一命令部署</td><td>本地一条命令搞定</td><td>需装 hexo-deployer-git、配 Token，换电脑要重配</td></tr><tr><td>GitHub Actions 自动部署</td><td>推送即发布，不依赖本地环境，私有仓库同样可用</td><td>首次要写一份工作流文件</td></tr></tbody></table><p>如果你已经把博客源码放在 GitHub 上，Actions 是更省心的选择；如果你不想把源码上传到 GitHub，可以继续用一命令部署（见文末）。</p><h1 id="前置准备"><a href="#前置准备" class="headerlink" title="前置准备"></a>前置准备</h1><h2 id="确认仓库与分支"><a href="#确认仓库与分支" class="headerlink" title="确认仓库与分支"></a>确认仓库与分支</h2><p>创建一个名为 <code>&lt;username&gt;.github.io</code> 的仓库（<code>&lt;username&gt;</code> 是你的 GitHub 用户名），把 Hexo 博客的源码推到默认分支（一般是 <code>main</code>）。</p><h2 id="确认-gitignore-包含-public"><a href="#确认-gitignore-包含-public" class="headerlink" title="确认 .gitignore 包含 public&#x2F;"></a>确认 .gitignore 包含 public&#x2F;</h2><p><code>public/</code> 是 Hexo 生成的静态文件目录，不需要、也不应该提交到仓库。确认 <code>.gitignore</code> 里有这一行：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">public/</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="确认本地-Node-js-主版本号"><a href="#确认本地-Node-js-主版本号" class="headerlink" title="确认本地 Node.js 主版本号"></a>确认本地 Node.js 主版本号</h2><p>在本地执行：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">node --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>记下主版本号，例如 <code>v20.y.z</code> 就记 <code>20</code>。工作流里的 Node.js 版本要和本地一致，避免”本地能生成、Actions 构建失败”的版本差问题。</p><h1 id="第一步：把-Pages-源切换为-GitHub-Actions"><a href="#第一步：把-Pages-源切换为-GitHub-Actions" class="headerlink" title="第一步：把 Pages 源切换为 GitHub Actions"></a>第一步：把 Pages 源切换为 GitHub Actions</h1><p>进入 GitHub 仓库页面，依次点击 <strong>Settings → Pages → Build and deployment → Source</strong>，把 Source 从”Deploy from a branch”改为 <strong>GitHub Actions</strong>，保存。</p><p>这一步不做，Actions 构建成功也不会发布。</p><h1 id="第二步：创建工作流文件"><a href="#第二步：创建工作流文件" class="headerlink" title="第二步：创建工作流文件"></a>第二步：创建工作流文件</h1><p>在博客源码仓库中新建文件 <code>.github/workflows/pages.yml</code>，内容如下（源自 Hexo 官方文档，把 <code>20</code> 换成你自己的 Node.js 主版本号）：</p><figure class="highlight yml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Pages</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">on:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">push:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">branches:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">main</span> <span class="comment"># default branch</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">jobs:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">build:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">runs-on:</span> <span class="string">ubuntu-latest</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">steps:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">uses:</span> <span class="string">actions/checkout@v4</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">with:</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">token:</span> <span class="string">$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class="string">secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN</span> <span class="string">&#125;&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="comment"># 如果仓库用到 submodule，取消下面一行的注释</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="comment"># submodules: recursive</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Use</span> <span class="string">Node.js</span> <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">uses:</span> <span class="string">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">with:</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="comment"># 填你本地的 Node.js 主版本号，如 20、22</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">node-version:</span> <span class="string">&quot;20&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Cache</span> <span class="string">NPM</span> <span class="string">dependencies</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">uses:</span> <span class="string">actions/cache@v4</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">with:</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">path:</span> <span class="string">node_modules</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">key:</span> <span class="string">$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class="string">runner.OS</span> <span class="string">&#125;&#125;-npm-cache</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">restore-keys:</span> <span class="string">|</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            $&#123;&#123; runner.OS &#125;&#125;-npm-cache</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Install</span> <span class="string">Dependencies</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">run:</span> <span class="string">npm</span> <span class="string">install</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Build</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">run:</span> <span class="string">npm</span> <span class="string">run</span> <span class="string">build</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Upload</span> <span class="string">Pages</span> <span class="string">artifact</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">uses:</span> <span class="string">actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">with:</span></span><br><span class="line">          <span class="attr">path:</span> <span class="string">./public</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">needs:</span> <span class="string">build</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">permissions:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">pages:</span> <span class="string">write</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">id-token:</span> <span class="string">write</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">environment:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">github-pages</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">url:</span> <span class="string">$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class="string">steps.deployment.outputs.page_url</span> <span class="string">&#125;&#125;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">runs-on:</span> <span class="string">ubuntu-latest</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">steps:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="attr">name:</span> <span class="string">Deploy</span> <span class="string">to</span> <span class="string">GitHub</span> <span class="string">Pages</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">id:</span> <span class="string">deployment</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">uses:</span> <span class="string">actions/deploy-pages@v4</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这份工作流分两个任务：</p><ul><li><strong>build</strong>：检出源码 → 安装指定版本的 Node.js → 安装依赖 → 执行 <code>npm run build</code> 生成静态文件 → 把 <code>public/</code> 打包成 Pages 产物。</li><li><strong>deploy</strong>：等 build 成功后，把产物发布到 GitHub Pages，并在 Actions 界面显示发布后的网址。</li></ul><p>几个容易忽略的点：</p><ul><li><code>npm run build</code> 对应脚手架自带的 <code>&quot;build&quot;: &quot;hexo generate&quot;</code>。如果你的 <code>package.json</code> 里没有 <code>build</code> 脚本，把这一步改成 <code>run: npx hexo generate</code>。</li><li><code>actions/cache@v4</code> 缓存的是 <code>node_modules</code>，依赖不变时可跳过重复安装，构建更快。</li><li><code>deploy</code> 任务的 <code>permissions</code> 必须保留 <code>pages: write</code> 和 <code>id-token: write</code>，否则没有发布权限。</li></ul><h2 id="可选：加一个手动触发开关"><a href="#可选：加一个手动触发开关" class="headerlink" title="可选：加一个手动触发开关"></a>可选：加一个手动触发开关</h2><p>有时只想改工作流文件本身、不想等一次自动构建，或者构建失败后想单独重跑，可以在 <code>on:</code> 里加一行：</p><figure class="highlight yml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">on:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">push:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">branches:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">main</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">workflow_dispatch:</span> <span class="comment"># 允许在 Actions 页面手动触发</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>加完后，在仓库 <strong>Actions</strong> 页面点进这个工作流，右上角会出现 <strong>Run workflow</strong> 按钮。</p><h1 id="第三步：提交推送，验证部署"><a href="#第三步：提交推送，验证部署" class="headerlink" title="第三步：提交推送，验证部署"></a>第三步：提交推送，验证部署</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git add .github/workflows/pages.yml</span><br><span class="line">git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;ci: add GitHub Actions auto deploy&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">git push origin main</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>推送后进入仓库 <strong>Actions</strong> 页面，能看到名为 Pages 的工作流正在运行：</p><ol><li>等 <code>build</code> 任务变绿，说明 Hexo 已成功生成静态文件。</li><li>等 <code>deploy</code> 任务变绿，说明已发布到 GitHub Pages。</li><li>打开 <code>https://&lt;username&gt;.github.io</code>，确认新文章已上线。</li></ol><p>从此以后，写文章的流程就是：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new post <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 写文章……</span></span><br><span class="line">git add . &amp;&amp; git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;post: 文章标题&quot;</span> &amp;&amp; git push</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>推送完成，部署自动开始，不用再碰本地的部署命令。</p><h1 id="第四步（可选）：自定义域名"><a href="#第四步（可选）：自定义域名" class="headerlink" title="第四步（可选）：自定义域名"></a>第四步（可选）：自定义域名</h1><p>如果你用了自定义域名（例如 <code>blog.example.com</code>），不要在 Pages 设置里只填域名就完事：每次 Actions 重新部署都会覆盖域名设置。</p><p>正确做法是在博客源码的 <code>source/</code> 目录下放一个 <code>CNAME</code> 文件，内容只有一行域名：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">blog.example.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Hexo 生成时会把这个文件原样复制到 <code>public/</code>，每次部署域名设置都不会丢。</p><h1 id="常见问题排查"><a href="#常见问题排查" class="headerlink" title="常见问题排查"></a>常见问题排查</h1><h2 id="构建失败，先看日志定位到哪一步"><a href="#构建失败，先看日志定位到哪一步" class="headerlink" title="构建失败，先看日志定位到哪一步"></a>构建失败，先看日志定位到哪一步</h2><p>Actions 页面点进失败的那次运行，红色叉号所在的步骤就是出问题的环节：<code>Install Dependencies</code> 失败多半是依赖问题，<code>Build</code> 失败多半是文章或主题配置问题。</p><h2 id="本地能生成，Actions-构建失败"><a href="#本地能生成，Actions-构建失败" class="headerlink" title="本地能生成，Actions 构建失败"></a>本地能生成，Actions 构建失败</h2><p>先核对工作流里的 <code>node-version</code> 是否和本地主版本号一致。Hexo 对 Node.js 版本有要求，版本差一个主版本就可能导致依赖装不上或生成报错。</p><h2 id="推送了文章，线上没有更新"><a href="#推送了文章，线上没有更新" class="headerlink" title="推送了文章，线上没有更新"></a>推送了文章，线上没有更新</h2><p>按顺序检查三点：</p><ol><li>Pages 的 Source 是否已改为 <strong>GitHub Actions</strong>（第一步）。</li><li>Actions 里那次运行是否全部变绿，有没有失败的任务。</li><li><code>public/</code> 是否被误提交进了仓库——它应该只由 Actions 生成。</li></ol><h2 id="构建卡住不动"><a href="#构建卡住不动" class="headerlink" title="构建卡住不动"></a>构建卡住不动</h2><p>GitHub Pages 构建偶尔会卡住或超时，先在 Actions 页面点 <strong>Re-run jobs</strong> 重跑一次，多数情况下重跑就能通过；连续多次在同一位置失败，再去看日志找原因。</p><h2 id="想换回一命令部署"><a href="#想换回一命令部署" class="headerlink" title="想换回一命令部署"></a>想换回一命令部署</h2><p>不喜欢 Actions 也可以随时换回本地部署。安装部署插件：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在博客根目录的 <code>_config.yml</code> 里加上：</p><figure class="highlight yml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/&lt;username&gt;/&lt;project&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">gh-pages</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后执行 <code>hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo deploy</code> 即可。两种方式可以并存，按需选用。</p><h1 id="小结"><a href="#小结" class="headerlink" title="小结"></a>小结</h1><ul><li>源码推 GitHub + Actions 自动构建发布，是目前维护 Hexo 博客最省心的方式：一次配置，之后只管写文章和 <code>git push</code>。</li><li>工作流以 Hexo 官方文档为准，关键点是 Node.js 版本与本地对齐、<code>deploy</code> 任务保留发布权限、Pages 源切换为 GitHub Actions。</li><li>用自定义域名时，记得把 <code>CNAME</code> 文件放在 <code>source/</code> 目录下，否则每次部署都会丢域名设置。</li></ul>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> 部署 </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
        <tags>
            
            <tag> hexo </tag>
            
            <tag> github-actions </tag>
            
            <tag> github-pages </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
